    "text": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/fhash.JPG\" style=\"width: 460px; height: 79px;\" />After acylation the formula will be <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>-</mo><mo>(</mo><msub><mi>NHCOCH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></math>. Hence, the change in the molecular mass is calculated as below</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>F</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#160;</mo><mn mathvariant=\"italic\">1</mn><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#160;</mo><mi>N</mi><msub><mi>H</mi><mn mathvariant=\"italic\">2</mn></msub><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#8594;</mo><mn mathvariant=\"italic\">14</mn><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">+</mo><mn mathvariant=\"italic\">2</mn><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">=</mo><mn mathvariant=\"italic\">16</mn><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#160;</mo><mi>u</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>s</mi><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mi>W</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#160;</mo><mi>I</mi><mi>t</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#160;</mo><mi>t</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>s</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#160;</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#160;</mo><mi>N</mi><mi>H</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#8722;</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>H</mi><mn mathvariant=\"italic\">3</mn></msub><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#160;</mo><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#160;</mo><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#8203;</mo><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#160;</mo><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#160;</mo><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#8594;</mo><mn mathvariant=\"italic\">14</mn><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">+</mo><mn mathvariant=\"italic\">1</mn><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">+</mo><mn mathvariant=\"italic\">12</mn><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">+</mo><mn mathvariant=\"italic\">16</mn><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">+</mo><mn ma